/* ============================================================================
   eSlams Arena app prototype · assets.js  [agent E]
   window.ESA: brand data-URIs, provider logo SVGs, outline icon set.
   No dependencies, no DOM access at load, safe under file://.

   ESA.mark            256px PNG, transparent. The royal-blue mark alone. Never re-tint it.
   ESA.wordmarkLight   480px PNG with DARK text, for light backgrounds.
   ESA.wordmarkDark    480px PNG with LIGHT text, for dark backgrounds.
   ESA.providerSvg     { slug: '<svg ...>' }  all 61 provider logos, viewBox kept, no width/height,
                       aria-hidden. Two kinds (see ESA.providerKind):
                         'glyph'  viewBox 0 0 24 24, authored as a white (#ffffff) mark meant to sit on a
                                  tinted tile. A CSS `fill` on the svg or its children overrides it.
                         'badge'  viewBox 0 0 64 64, a self-contained rounded-square badge that carries its
                                  own background colour. Do not put it on a tint tile; show it as is.
   ESA.providerLogo(slug[, size])   resolves aliases (see ALIASES below, case-insensitive; a model id such
                       as 'google/gemini-2.5-flash' resolves through its provider part). Returns the svg
                       markup (with width/height when size is given) or null when unknown.
   ESA.providerKind(slug)           'glyph' | 'badge' | null
   ESA.providerResolve(slug)        canonical slug in providerSvg, or null
   ESA.icons           { name: '<svg ... width="20" height="20">' }  24 viewBox, stroke currentColor,
                       stroke-width 1.75, round caps and joins, no fill.
   ESA.icon(name[, size=20])        same markup with width/height set; '' when the name is unknown.
   ESA.iconNames       array of every icon name.

   Icon set. Contract: close back chevron (points right; rotate for other directions) search shuffle play
   help more check share replay settings signout sound eye user, and the arena glyphs g_chess g_board g_card
   g_social g_c4 g_ttt g_go g_hex g_dice g_poker.
   Also provided: soundoff globe apple github google lock bell trash sun moon system, plus extras
   plus minus eyeoff mail clock alert. Brand marks (apple github google) are simplified monochrome outlines.
   ============================================================================ */
